{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of seven integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. What is the maximum number of the seven integers that can be larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/e/07e5b854b0d45b295df81b80b536adcbc7f2fcf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 5\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the first six integers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the last number can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d9b3a03ebb39cf7e908c3f89bbc4c444d93cb6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-14\\cdot 6) - 1 = -85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" />.  The sum of all seven integers will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>However, if all seven integers are over <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the smallest possible sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d2aafdcd663c94591a519e778b1210a624c8323.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14\\cdot 7 = 98$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55bdade53f471aab49f63d1a734979cc0c636640.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"29\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollo